  "text": "Neck & shoulder muscle pain, upper back pain, upper right abdominal pain, loose stools, nausea, weakness, anxiety.\nAll symptoms began after starting Protonix and advancing to Nexium 2x/day @\n40 mg.\nSymptoms progressively got worse.\nHeat and ibuprofen not helpful.\nQuality of life degraded immensely with use of PPI.\nCardiac ruled out.\nHave discontinued this drug on my own.\n",
